    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UZG Remastered is a\u00a0zombie survival shooter inspired by classic round-based zombie shooters.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UZGR is on an updated engine on Unity 6, taking advantage of its features.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updates and Quality of Life, UZGR presents many new features and polishes old ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards! UZGR has a built-in leaderboard that is global and cross-platform! Fight for the highest score.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the future a, Level\u00a0Creator, you can now use an in-game level editor to create and share levels.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UZG Remastered is a\u00a0zombie survival shooter inspired by classic round-based zombie shooters.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UZGR is on an updated engine on Unity 6, taking advantage of its features.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updates and Quality of Life, UZGR presents many new features and polishes old ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards! UZGR has a built-in leaderboard that is global and cross-platform! Fight for the highest score.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the future a, Level\u00a0Creator, you can now use an in-game level editor to create and share levels.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "UZG Remastered is a low-poly, single-player, and round-based zombie shooter. Progress through levels with increasingly harder enemies and upgrade yourself along the way.",
